\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1\cf0 . Have mercy on us, God most High,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 We lift our hearts to thee;
\par Have mercy on us worms of earth,
\par Most HOLY TRINITY.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  When heaven and earth were yet unmade,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 when time was yet unknown,
\par You, in your bliss and majesty
\par Did live and love alone.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  Lord God, Thou has no begining
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Thou was not created;
\par To everywhere Thou can be found
\par Thou alone is our God.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  How wonderful creation is,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 The work that Thou did bless
\par And Oh, what then must Thou be like,
\par Eternal loveliness.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  Incline Thines ears to me O Lord
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 a poor and sinful man
\par I bless you, Lord God Almighty,
\par Thou art who changeth not
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6.  Most ancient of all mysteries!
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Before Thy Throne we lie;
\par Have mercy now, most Merciful,
\par \pard      Most HOLY TRINITY.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

